# Reference: measure one player and the big hash, read the limits, do the napkin from the number, then remove the big key
# with UNLINK (the memory is freed on a background thread). The number you type in the answer box is the first reply.
MEMORY USAGE player:p-028
OBJECT ENCODING player:p-028
HLEN player:p-028
CONFIG GET hash-max-listpack-entries
CONFIG GET hash-max-listpack-value
HLEN big:hash
OBJECT ENCODING big:hash
MEMORY USAGE big:hash
CONFIG GET maxmemory
UNLINK big:hash
EXISTS big:hash
